  Two-Headed_Eagl examined the Codex of Mental Prowess and discovered the 
following properties:
  The Codex of Mental Prowess raises your Psychic Magic ability by one 
level.  For example, a skill level of 0 would rise to skill level 1.  The 
reader of this strangely compelling work becomes completely engrossed with 
it, and after this book is perused, it crumbles to dust and merges with the 
sands of time.  Use the "Use Item" Action to invoke its powers.

