GENERAL INTELLIGENCE REPORT

Kingdom of Uga-Buga Makumb (#1):
  In late summer, Uga-Buga Makumb (#1) rode his flying armies into Mare 
Imbrium.
  In fall, Uga-Buga Makumb rode his flying armies over to the Aries Sea.  
The Aries Sea was overrun and occupied by Uga-Buga Makumb's fleet.

  In early winter, a conquering horde owing their allegiance to 
Shaman Uga-Buga Makumb Stuffy doll invaded the province of Maicuru, a Jungle 
area owned by Giovanna (#7).  Maicuru was conquered by Pascal (#78)'s host.

  In spring, soldiers bearing the battle-standards of the Uga-Buga Makumb 
(#1)ian empire marched on the Forest province of Marigold, a land defended 
by the soldiers of Giovanna (#7).  Marigold was overrun by Alaric (#22)'s 
host.


Kingdom of Giovanna (#7):
  In spring, soldiers bearing the battle-standards of the Uga-Buga Makumb 
(#1)ian empire marched on the Forest province of Marigold, a land defended 
by the soldiers of Giovanna (#7).  Marigold was overrun by Alaric (#22)'s 
host.

  In early winter, a conquering horde owing their allegiance to 
Shaman Uga-Buga Makumb Stuffy doll (#1) invaded the province of Maicuru, a 
Jungle area owned by Giovanna (#7).  Maicuru was conquered by Pascal (#78)'s 
