END MOVES REPORT

  Congratulations!  Your kingdom has attained skill level 5 in Sageness.  At 
levels 5 and up, there is not necessarily an increase in the chance to 
invent something.  Instead, the Sage attracts a company of philosphers and 
builds a University in his province of birth.  All characters of this 
exalted level are awarded a new Advanced Ability: 
  SAGE'S UNIVERSITY:  The Sage gains an additional plus 1 level when 
researching inventions if he is at his University (the location is shown in 
the Characters listing).  All percentage bonuses are cumulative.


END MOVES REPORT

  Congratulations!  You have reached level 6 in Sageness.  All characters of 
this high level gain the following Advanced Ability: 
  SAGE'S UNIVERSITY:  The Sage gains an additional plus 1 level when 
researching inventions if he is at his University (the location is shown in 
the Characters listing).  All percentage bonuses are cumulative.


END MOVES REPORT

  Congratulations!  You have reached level 5 in Thievery.  At levels 5 and 
up, the usual 15% per level increase in stealing ability is discontinued.  
Instead, your characters of this high level gain a new Advanced Ability: 
  THIEF MASTERY:  The Thief adds 15% to his chance to Steal (however, the 
maximum chance is always 95%).


END MOVES REPORT

  Congratulations!  You have reached level 5 in Spying.  At levels 5 and up, 
there are no further increases in the Spy Table.  Instead, your characters 
of this high level are awarded the following Advanced Ability: 
  SPY- BLACKMAIL:  When the Spy Trails a foreign king and ends any phase in 
the same province, there is about a 20% chance of getting some dirt on him.  
If that happens, a message is delivered, with instructions to pay off your 
kingdom (the amount will average about 15 gold).  If no payola is coughed 
up, he will lose 3 times that much in tax revenues when the dirt is given to 
the tabloids, causing great social turmoil.  If the blackmail money isn't 
paid, the next attempt will be worth about half as much gold.  Note: it's 
easier to find dirt on a king tending towards evil, harder for good kings; 
but evil kings pay less gold because their bad habits are already somewhat 
known; and, rich kings pay more gold.  Blackmail is usable once per turn on 
a kingdom.


END MOVES REPORT

  Congratulations!  You have attained level 6 in Spying.  Your characters of 
this exalted level gain a new Advanced Ability: 
  SPY- SUPER SLEUTH:  When the Spy uses the Trail or Pursue actions, success 
is automatic, and the Spy can also guess how far away the target is (the 
guess may be off by one province).


END MOVES REPORT

  Congratulations!  You have reached skill level 7 in Spying.  All 
characters of this exalted level gain the following Advanced Ability: 
  SPY- EXPANDED SPYING:  When using the Spy Province action, the Spy gains 
information on what features are known to the owning kingdom.  With the 
Trail action, estimates are gained for skills, and for offices held.


END MOVES REPORT

  Congratulations!  Your kingdom has attained skill level 8 in Spying.  All 
characters of this exalted level gain the following Advanced Ability: 
  SPY- BRAINWASH:  When the spy uses the Talk tactic on any hero, that 
character will move one step closer in alignment to the Spy's alignment.


END MOVES REPORT

